sequenceDiagram

    actor Employee
    participant Client as MAUI / Web Client
    participant API as Transactions API (/api/transactions)
    participant Service as Unified Transactions Service
    participant File as Receipt Storage
    participant DB as SQL Server 2022
    participant Audit as Audit Service
    participant Notify as Notification Service

    Employee->>Client: Open Unified Transaction Dashboard
    Employee->>Client: Add expense item to active advance
    Employee->>Client: Attach receipt photo or text note

    Client->>API: POST /api/transactions/expenses
    API->>API: Authenticate JWT & authorize permission

    API->>Service: Record expense item
    Service->>Service: Validate expense input
    Service->>DB: Save Expense (Status = PendingReview)

    opt Receipt image attached
        Client->>API: Upload receipt file
        API->>File: Save receipt image to disk
        File-->>API: File storage path
        API->>DB: Save Receipt metadata record
    end

    Service->>Audit: Record expense submission event
    Service->>Notify: Send review alert to Manager / Super Admin

    Service-->>API: Expense item saved
    API-->>Client: Success (201 Created) + Pending Review status